OL,3,GNEWSAWhat you need to know about Great
OL,4,ASouth Run 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of runners and spectators are
OL,7,Fexpected in Portsmouth this weekend for
OL,8,Fthe Great South Run.
OL,10,FThe 10-mile (16km) race attracts elite
OL,11,Frunners as well as amateur club
OL,12,Fathletes and charity fundraisers.
OL,14,FSpectators line the route to cheer the
OL,15,F26,000 runners from the start on Avenue
OL,16,Fde Caen, through the streets of
OL,17,FPortsmouth and Southsea, passing
OL,18,Flandmarks including HMS Victory and the
OL,19,FSpinnaker Tower.
OL,21,FOn Saturday, the 5km race starts at
OL,22,F09:00 BST.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
